{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And I drew near.</b> Its sense hints at lying with, as in \"do not draw near to a woman\" (Exodus 19:15):" "And <b>the prophetess</b> is the wife of the prophet, and she is called thus because her husband is a prophet, or she too was a prophetess:"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:52:42.860525174Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}